					"name": "tracks",
					"documentation": "Una pista dentro de una edición. FKs release_id -> releases.id y recording_id -> recordings.id. UNIQUE (release_id, disc_number, track_number); Release contributions belong to the release, not individual tracks. CHECK disc_number > 0 AND track_number > 0. No UNIQUE individual en release_id/recording_id: una grabación puede aparecer en varias ediciones y posiciones. Approved 2026-10-13: nullable title preserves the edition-specific literal title; displayTitle is derived from title or the currently published and visible recording title, never persisted.",
