						"$ref": "AAAAAAGeD8zCEIDLyT4="
					},
					"name": "track_artist_credits",
					"documentation": "Creditos de presentacion de una pista (main/featured/remixer). track_id -> tracks.id segun la relacion existente. Propiedad editorial: release de la pista. No atribuye autoria ni participacion tecnica; recording_contributions conserva los creditos de la grabacion. La wiki no reinterpreta track_id como recording_id. Vease docs/wiki-model.md. Presentation credits referencing artists.id, not technical/creative contributions. Retain credited order; no inferred authorship, performance or production. Identity metadata is resolved through artists.catalog_identity_id. See docs/music-credits-model.md. PK (artist_id,track_id); rank is one main/featured/remixer classification per artist and track; position >= 0. credited_as NULL resolves through artists.catalog_identity_id to catalog_identities.display_name.",
