					"documentation": "One concrete concert/performance. type=concert in v1. Optional tour; two shows at the same venue/date may be different events, so do not deduplicate by title/date/location. Optional partial date and location; unknown is not a fabricated date. time requires full Gregorian date and IANA timezone; timezone may exist without time. No automatic performed state based on elapsed date. Mandatory independent review includes schedule, status, participants, organizers, links and tour reassignment. Previous dates remain in wiki revisions. Year 1..9999, month 1..12 and valid day including leap years. postponed clears current date/time; previous values remain in revisions. cancelled keeps last known date. Unknown/local ambiguous time stays NULL unless evidence resolves it. External sources back all material event facts.",
